# Board patch series, applied last, after the arch and SoC series.
#
# This replaces the OS profile's series rather than extending it. That series holds one
# optional patch plus the two prelink patches; the optional one is dropped here:
#
#   zzz-boot-progress.patch patches the `#if XNU_SHENG_PMGR` block in bsd/kern/bsd_init.c
#   that only the SM8550 SoC series inserts (sheng-platform-power.patch). On SM8250 that
#   block does not exist, so the patch cannot apply. Boot progress is a framebuffer
#   diagnostic overlay, and CONFIG_XNU_BOOT_PROGRESS is unset, so nothing links against it.
#
# The two prelink patches are required: XnuPrelink needs the security-init hook and the
# sparse index.
